## Interface: 16001
## Title: Comms
## Notes: All-in-one text chat for WoW Forever: chat formatting, URL and invite links, alerts, whisper windows, chat and typed history that survive /reload, a bigger chat box with Tab completion, channel auto-leave and quick lines. Steps back in chat lockdown. By Nine Point Labs, not related to Forever Comms Voice / Guild Comms / Group Comms or Quick Comms.
